@fact corvin.locks
# en: Knows every locked door in the academy and owes money to at least three people.
text [8de015] = 学院里每一扇锁着的门他都知道，而且至少欠着三个人的钱。

@fact corvin.last_warning
# en: He is on his last warning. One more detention and they send him home, and home is not a good place.
text [b33ba6] = 他已经是最后一次警告了。再被罚一次禁闭，就会被送回家——而家，不是个好地方。
# en: Court him.
hint [3025c4] = 追求他。

@fact corvin.brother
# en: His brother turns up for money and threatens to tell the headmistress where Corvin learned to pick locks.
text [bb32a8] = 他哥哥会找上门来要钱，还威胁要告诉院长科尔文是在哪儿学会撬锁的。

@fact corvin.grandfather
# en: His grandfather's lucky deck sat in the confiscation vault for decades. It really is lucky.
text [26a338] = 他祖父的幸运牌在没收库里躺了几十年。那副牌是真的幸运。

@fact corvin.cartographers
# en: He runs the Midnight Cartographers, the club that doesn't exist.
text [d80fd1] = 他是午夜制图社的头儿——那个不存在的社团。
# en: Become his friend, and accept the invitation that comes at night.
hint [53b37a] = 和他交朋友，接受夜里送来的邀请。

@fact corvin.trolls
# en: He once owed thirty crowns to trolls and offered to pay you back with a goat.
text [976180] = 他曾欠巨魔三十克朗，还提出用一只山羊来还你钱。
# en: Lend him money when he asks.
hint [045025] = 他开口借钱时借给他。

@fact corvin.sundays
# en: His grandfather could find a lost thing in any house, and taught him to shuffle on rainy Sundays. He's the one person Corvin talks about without a joke.
text [6974c6] = 他祖父能在任何房子里找到丢失的东西，还在下雨的星期天教他洗牌。那是科尔文唯一不开玩笑地谈起的人。
# en: Get his lucky deck back for him, then ask about his grandfather.
hint [868d69] = 帮他把幸运牌拿回来，然后问问他的祖父。

@fact corvin.master_map
# en: The Cartographers' last Keeper left him the Master Map. Whoever draws two lines in its old blanks keeps it with him.
text [811a30] = 制图社的上一任保管人把总图留给了他。谁能在总图那两块老空白里画上两道线，就和他一起保管它。
# en: Join the Cartographers, and help fill in the blanks on their map.
hint [51f15e] = 加入制图社，帮忙填上地图上的空白。

@fact corvin.lane
# en: Everyone on Ashby Lane knows him, lends him nothing, and would hide him from the watch without being asked.
text [d69d28] = 阿什比巷人人都认识他，谁也不借他东西，可谁都会不等开口就把他藏起来躲巡夜人。
# en: Spend a break in the capital, and find Ashby Lane.
hint [2ce7e4] = 假期去王都，找到阿什比巷。

@fact corvin.sill
# en: He sends his mother money he doesn't have, left on her windowsill at night, so that he doesn't have to go in.
text [149093] = 他把自己其实没有的钱寄给母亲：夜里放在她的窗台上，这样就不用进门。
# en: Walk Ashby Lane after dark, once you are friends.
hint [061166] = 成为朋友后，入夜去阿什比巷走走。
